{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本準則依職業安全衛生法第六條第三項規定訂定之。","id":"N0060023/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"76011000189eab95bcfd7d73edd2bb3f11681186c86f1258c826ce9368d770fa","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":23,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"雇主設置之標示，除其他法規或國家標準另有規定外，應依本準則之規定辦理。","id":"N0060023/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"d916d5c2eca7ba99493448460a05ec9c33f3f227d77683699b92cb922d4add7e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":35,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本準則所稱安全衛生標示（以下簡稱標示），其用途種類及告知事項如下：\n一、防止危害：\n（一）禁止標示：嚴格管制有發生危險之虞之行為，包括禁止煙火、禁止攀越、禁止通行等。\n（二）警告標示：警告既存之危險或有害狀況，包括高壓電、墜落、高熱、輻射等危險。\n（三）注意標示：提醒避免相對於人員行為而發生之危害，包括當心地面、注意頭頂等。\n二、一般說明或提示：\n（一）用途或處所之標示，包括反應塔、鍋爐房、安全門、伐木區、急救箱、急救站、救護車、診所、消防栓、機房等。\n（二）操作或儀控之標示，包括有一定順序之機具操作方法、儀表控制盤之說明、安全管控方法等。\n（三）說明性質之標示，包括工作場所各種行動方向、管制信號意義等。","id":"N0060023/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"e47cab8dac88220d139e7bc5f71d141b5099fcf9fd6e4c6bbfbace0431749369","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":306,"children":[{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":34,"end":164,"children":[{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":42,"end":84,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":84,"end":124,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:3","kind":"subitem","number":3,"start":124,"end":164,"children":[]}]},{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":164,"end":306,"children":[{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":175,"end":229,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":229,"end":274,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:3","kind":"subitem","number":3,"start":274,"end":306,"children":[]}]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"標示之形狀種類如下：\n一、圓形：用於禁止。\n二、尖端向上之正三角形：用於警告。\n三、尖端向下之正三角形：用於注意。\n四、正方形或長方形：用於一般說明或提示。","id":"N0060023/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"21452e40c28c7659b2da7167162c153ea03d4952d02f3d843392b00bac6b9e14","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":78,"children":[{"id":"N0060023/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":11,"end":22,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":22,"end":40,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":40,"end":58,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:4/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":58,"end":78,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"標示應依設置之永久性或暫時性，採固定式或移動式，並應依下列規定設置：\n一、大小及位置力求明顯易見，安裝穩妥。\n二、材質堅固耐久，並適當處理所有尖角銳邊，以免危險。","id":"N0060023/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"f08e9510368e1ffdb2866860d6ac72fb0a9919151f6842f417db0e515df2566c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":81,"children":[{"id":"N0060023/a:5/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":35,"end":55,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:5/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":55,"end":81,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"標示應力求簡明，並以文字及圖案併用。文字以中文為主，不得採用難以辨識之字體。\n前項標示之文字書寫方式如下：\n一、直式：由上而下，由右而左。\n二、橫式：由左而右。但有箭號指示方向者，依箭號方向。","id":"N0060023/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"5bfeeaff25cbf40c6d2ef9bf6fdbf784ca226ac1161c2fe8a4f5e4bd78ad7bd2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":39,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:6/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":39,"end":96,"children":[{"id":"N0060023/a:6/p:2/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":54,"end":70,"children":[]},{"id":"N0060023/a:6/p:2/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":70,"end":96,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"標示之顏色，應依國家標準 CNS9328  安全用顏色通則之規定，其底色、外廓、文字及圖案之用色，應力求對照顯明，以利識別。","id":"N0060023/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"7f160b8def728cd448694158c36cb9bcae77f9019ce120f7d4bf6eed5c60b124","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":62,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"本準則自中華民國一百零三年七月三日施行。","id":"N0060023/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"3f1a84511dca51dbb04dd3deab885327241a842cd297db07e54bfdb243c11421","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"N0060023/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":20,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國六十年十一月八日內政部（60）台內勞字第 444536 號令訂定\n  發布\n2.中華民國六十九年十二月十二日內政部（69）台內勞字第 57604  號令\n  修正發布全文 8  條\n3.中華民國七十七年十月二十四日行政院勞工委員會（77）台勞安二字第\n  24433 號令修正發布\n4.中華民國八十七年四月二十九日行政院勞工委員會（87）台勞安二字第\n  015911  號令修正發布全文 8  條及名稱\n  （原名稱：工業安全標示設置準則；新名稱：工業安全衛生標示設置準\n  則）\n5.中華民國一百零三年七月二日勞動部勞職授字第 10302007131  號令修\n  正發布名稱及全文 8  條；並自一百零三年七月三日施行\n  （原名稱：工業安全衛生標示設置準則；新名稱：職業安全衛生標示設\n  置準則）","id":"N0060023","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2014-07-02","name":"職業安全衛生標示設置準則","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=N0060023","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"51d209c9b930fefaf2fc7b7f678ff3002d2cbf651a939e215e01e139dda791cb","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2014-07-02","effectiveDate":""}}